00:35:40,860 --> 00:35:43,020
is what size are each of these things?

778
00:35:43,020 --> 00:35:46,500
So who can tell me what the shape

779
00:35:46,500 --> 00:35:50,680
of the partial of z with respect to x would be when x equals a?

780
00:35:55,500 --> 00:35:59,060
I can give you one freebie, if it's helpful.

781
00:35:59,060 --> 00:36:07,940
So if we say the size of you is p, the size of z is m,

